{"availability":"available","full":"DiegoHahn/Solar-hub","name":"Solar-hub","description":"Solar plant monitoring: edge collectors (Modbus TCP / Solarman V5) on an Orange Pi, Supabase, Next.js dashboard with AI energy advisor. Live demo with mock data.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-02T17:07:57Z","updated":"2026-10-14T18:10:54Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://solar-hub-diego-2112.vercel.app/demo","topics":["gemini-ai","iot","modbus","nextjs","orange-pi","python","solar-energy","supabase","typescript"],"demo":"https://solar-hub-diego-2112.vercel.app/demo","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.347Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.347Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.347Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:25:27.792Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T07:01:43.639Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.347Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Versão em Português • Demo • Architecture • Setup • Testing and CI • Known limitations • What I learned","My family has a small solar plant with three inverters from two different brands: one Solis and two GoodWe. Each brand has its own app and its own cloud, and none of them shows the whole plant in one place. The electricity bill and the solar credits live on a third site, the portal of the local utility cooperative (Cooperaliança).","Solar Hub puts all of that in one dashboard. A small Python collector on an Orange Pi reads the inverters directly on the home network, pushes the readings to Supabase, and also pulls the billing and credit data from the utility portal a few times a day. A Next.js dashboard shows generation, inverter details, credits and bills, and a daily analysis written by Google Gemini from those numbers."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DiegoHahn/Solar-hub/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1fd91c594300f8ad6bad00a7f24b2a6f75dc40a90b7e1a0858f83918b3e4b1ff","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.434Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.434Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Versão em Português • Demo • Architecture • Setup • Testing and CI • Known limitations • What I learned","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DiegoHahn/Solar-hub/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"It runs on bundled sample data, needs no login, and has an EN / PT language toggle.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DiegoHahn/Solar-hub/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Login: Supabase Auth with Google or email and password, through @supabase/ssr.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DiegoHahn/Solar-hub/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"1fd91c594300f8ad6bad00a7f24b2a6f75dc40a90b7e1a0858f83918b3e4b1ff","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DiegoHahn/Solar-hub/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.434Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-14T18:10:54Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DiegoHahn/Solar-hub/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.435Z","hash":"1fd91c594300f8ad6bad00a7f24b2a6f75dc40a90b7e1a0858f83918b3e4b1ff","originalBytes":18810,"storedBytes":18810,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.347Z","subjects":["Data & dashboards"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"AI & machine learning","subjects":["Data & dashboards"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Data & dashboards","source":"metadata","match":"dashboard"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Automation & workflows","Mobile","Maths & algorithms"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://solar-hub-diego-2112.vercel.app/demo","attemptedAt":"2026-10-16T00:13:01.075Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","